basylous.display:
**英英释义**：a. Pertaining to, or having the nature of, a basyle;
   electro-positive; basic; -- opposed to chlorous.

**中文释义**：[医] 硷性的, 硷式的

bird-witted.display:
**英英释义**：a. Flighty; passing rapidly from one subject to another;
   not having the faculty of attention.

**中文释义**：a. 轻浮的, 心思不专一的

bivalved.display:
**英英释义**：a. Having two valves, as the oyster and some seed pods;
   bivalve.

**中文释义**：双瓣的,双壳的

